<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 700 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 700 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 700 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.</p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.35 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY     700 MLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> DETAILS</p>
<p> BILLS/FRG MAR 14/17   700 MLN*   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>* INTEREST RATE - 5-31/32 PCT (INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE   RATES)</p>
</text>
